{"id":69046,"date":"2025-10-01T07:09:17","date_gmt":"2025-10-01T06:09:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69046"},"modified":"2026-11-08T13:38:21","modified_gmt":"2026-11-08T12:38:21","slug":"corrida-de-reis","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-de-reis\/","title":{"rendered":"I Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Vila de Porto de M\u00f3s 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">I Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Vila de Porto de M\u00f3s 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>I Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Vila de Porto de M\u00f3s 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>9 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, com partida e secretariado na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Ponte de S\u00e3o Pedro<\/strong>, no cora\u00e7\u00e3o de <strong>Porto de M\u00f3s<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Esta edi\u00e7\u00e3o inaugural de atletismo de estrada abre o calend\u00e1rio desportivo de 2027 na regi\u00e3o, sob parecer t\u00e9cnico favor\u00e1vel da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Distrital de Atletismo de Leiria (ADAL).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo arranca \u00e0s <strong>15:30<\/strong> com os escal\u00f5es da <strong>Corrida Jovem<\/strong> (Sub-10 a Sub-18, em dist\u00e2ncias dos 500 m aos 3.000 m), seguindo-se \u00e0s <strong>17:00<\/strong> a <strong>Corrida dos Reis de 10 km<\/strong> (Sub-20, Seniores e Veteranos) e \u00e0s <strong>17:15<\/strong> a <strong>Caminhada Noturna D. Fuas Roupinho de 6 km<\/strong>. A prova percorre as art\u00e9rias hist\u00f3ricas da vila dominada pelo seu imponente castelo de coruch\u00e9us verdes, disponibilizando banhos nos balne\u00e1rios do Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Porto de M\u00f3s.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 da responsabilidade do <strong>Grupo Desportivo das Pedreiras<\/strong>, com o apoio institucional da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Porto de M\u00f3s<\/strong>, atribuindo pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos tr\u00eas primeiros da classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral masculina, feminina e coletiva (100 \u20ac, 75 \u20ac e 50 \u20ac), al\u00e9m do Pr\u00e9mio D. Fuas Roupinho destinado aos melhores atletas do concelho. Descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a> e calcula o teu ritmo na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/sp