<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As provas da Corrida Jovem (Sub-10 a Sub-18, de 500 m a 3.000 m) decorrem entre as 15:30 e as 16:30. A Corrida Principal dos Reis (10 km) parte \u00e0s 17:00 e a Caminhada D. Fuas Roupinho (6 km) tem in\u00edcio \u00e0s 17:15.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os valores e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online at\u00e9 4 de janeiro de 2027: a Corrida Principal de 10 km custa 12,00 \u20ac (11,00 \u20ac para atletas federados), a Caminhada de 6 km custa 8,00 \u20ac e a Corrida Jovem \u00e9 gratuita (com op\u00e7\u00e3o de t-shirt do evento por 7,00 \u20ac).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funcionam o secretariado e os balne\u00e1rios?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona junto \u00e0 zona de partida na Ponte de S\u00e3o Pedro, enquanto os balne\u00e1rios para banhos est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Porto de M\u00f3s.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios atribu\u00eddos na competi\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova atribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos 3 primeiros da geral masculina, feminina e coletiva (100 \u20ac, 75 \u20ac e 50 \u20ac), trof\u00e9us por escal\u00e3o e o Pr\u00e9mio D. Fuas Roupinho para os 3 melhores atletas masculinos e femininos naturais ou residentes no concelho de Porto de M\u00f3s.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"I Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Vila de Porto de M\u00f3s 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-09\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-09\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Ponte de S\u00e3o Pedro, Porto de M\u00f3s, Leiria\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Porto de M\u00f3s\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A I Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Vila de Porto de M\u00f3s 2027 realiza-se a 9 de janeiro em Leiria. Corrida de 10 km, caminhada de 6 km e jovens. Garante a tua inscri\u00e7\u00e3o!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-corrida-de-reis.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida dos Reis \u2013 10 km\", \"price\": \"12.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.recordepessoal.pt\/evento\/icorridadosreis-viladeportodemos\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada D. Fuas Roupinho \u2013 6 km\", \"